WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.648 --> 00:00:02.629
Seduma Trade arrives as a zip. Check its SHA256 first.

2
00:00:02.779 --> 00:00:08.272
Unzip, make a virtual environment, install. No keys needed.

3
00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:14.169
Start Practice mode. It listens on localhost only. Live trading: Off.

4
00:00:14.319 --> 00:00:18.388
Welcome to Paper Practice. Nothing here uses real money.

5
00:00:18.538 --> 00:00:21.788
Pick what to practice. The example symbol is only for learning.

6
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:27.939
Acknowledge the Paper disclosures. This does not turn on Live.

7
00:00:28.089 --> 00:00:32.422
Optional: tick the order-practice sample. It requests one simulated order. Nothing is sent.

8
00:00:32.572 --> 00:00:34.904
Run one Practice cycle.

9
00:00:35.054 --> 00:00:40.588
One simulated fill recorded. It is a Practice fill, not a live fill.

10
00:00:40.738 --> 00:00:44.195
Home. Paper Practice and Live: Off stay on screen. The Neural Agency Engine researches; you bring the rules.

11
00:00:44.345 --> 00:00:48.515
A 7-day Practice Dojo teaches the basics, on your own computer.

12
00:00:48.665 --> 00:00:53.235
Activity lists the simulated fill. Simulated, not live.

13
00:00:53.385 --> 00:01:00.143
The Practice results log stays on this computer. Figures are simulated, not a forecast.

14
00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:04.666
Safety: Live is off by default. Practice only, auto-trading off, real sending off.

15
00:01:04.816 --> 00:01:09.774
Turning Live on takes three acknowledgments and a typed word. We are not doing that.

16
00:01:09.924 --> 00:01:13.854
Stay in Practice. Emergency stop is always available and does not close positions.

17
00:01:14.004 --> 00:01:17.010
Practice your trades first, then go Live whenever you're ready.
